# AYN Odin (SDM845): the power/charge LED is the PMI8998 LPG green channel and
# comes up at full brightness from the DT default-state=on. Dim it to a subtle
# indicator level the instant the LED registers, so there's no bright-green flash
# during boot before armada-control takes over. Keep this value in sync with
# armada-control's LED_GROUPS["power"]["on"]. No-op on devices without this LED.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="leds", KERNEL=="green:indicator", ATTR{brightness}="64"
